{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13600100","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13600100","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1360010001:1":{"text":"哇，太棒了，孩子们，你们击退了怪兽，重演了过去的传说！","source_cn":"哇，太棒了，孩子们，你们击退了怪兽，重演了过去的传说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBAF17148E41CF1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1360010002:1":{"text":"话是这么说，芙拉贝尔老师，这次的怪兽好像不太厉害呢！","source_cn":"话是这么说，芙拉贝尔老师，这次的怪兽好像不太厉害呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x664D94C0B223AC6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1360010003:1":{"text":"什、什么叫不太厉害？！骑士满满可是使出了全力的！","source_cn":"什、什么叫不太厉害？！骑士满满可是使出了全力的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28C5950EACDD2A2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1360010004:1":{"text":"但你们只是发出了几声可爱的叫声，说自己是怪兽，一点伪装都没有做。一点都不可怕！","source_cn":"但你们只是发出了几声可爱的叫声，说自己是怪兽，一点伪装...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB23FB75E22B3240","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1360010005:1":{"text":"其实、很、很可爱……","source_cn":"其实、很、很可爱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FBE48BCD26C57B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_tit